Today we are making the Clarity Agent available to every advisory client. It was built inside our own engagements to remove the manual work that slows boards down.

## What It Does

The agent assembles board packs from source systems, highlights changes in key risk indicators since the last meeting, and links every figure back to its origin so directors can verify it in one click.

## What It Does Not Do

It does not make decisions. Every recommendation is labelled, traceable and owned by a named executive — the same standard we ask of any human adviser.
